{"seq":3,"slug":"serving-frameworks","title":"服务框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/deployment-and-inference/serving-frameworks","wordCount":771,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务框架\">服务框架</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务框架解决的是「把模型变成可靠在线服务」这件事，几个核心概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>服务化挑战</strong>：模型体积大、推理延迟高、显存管理复杂、并发处理困难——专用框架针对这四点提供开箱方案。</li>\n<li><strong>KV 缓存管理</strong>：以 vLLM 的 PagedAttention 为代表，借鉴操作系统虚拟内存分页管理 KV 缓存，减少碎片。</li>\n<li><strong>连续批处理</strong>：动态替换完成请求、持续填满批次，是拉开吞吐差距的核心机制。</li>\n<li><strong>张量并行</strong>：把单个模型切分到多张 GPU，是部署大模型（如 70B）的必要手段。</li>\n<li><strong>OpenAI 兼容 API</strong>：主流框架都提供兼容接口，使客户端可无缝切换、便于迁移与集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型时抓住三个轴即可：<strong>吞吐需求、部署环境、生态集成</strong>——需要高吞吐且有 NVIDIA GPU 时 vLLM/SGLang 是默认答案，本地体验选 Ollama，多模型企业部署选 Triton。</p>\n<h2 id=\"llm-服务化挑战\">LLM 服务化挑战</h2><p>将 LLM 部署为可靠的在线服务面临独特挑战：模型体积大、推理延迟高、显存管理复杂、并发处理困难。专用的服务框架提供了开箱即用的解决方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Clients[&quot;客户端请求&quot;] --&gt; LB[&quot;负载均衡&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; S1[&quot;推理服务实例 1&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; S2[&quot;推理服务实例 2&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; GPU1[&quot;GPU 集群&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; GPU2[&quot;GPU 集群&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Clients[\"客户端请求\"] --&gt; LB[\"负载均衡\"]\n    LB --&gt; S1[\"推理服务实例 1\"]\n    LB --&gt; S2[\"推理服务实例 2\"]\n    S1 --&gt; GPU1[\"GPU 集群\"]\n    S2 --&gt; GPU2[\"GPU 集群\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流框架对比\">主流框架对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>开发方</th>\n<th>核心特性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>许可证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vLLM</td>\n<td>UC Berkeley</td>\n<td>PagedAttention, 高吞吐</td>\n<td>生产级高吞吐服务</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TGI</td>\n<td>Hugging Face</td>\n<td>流式输出, Flash Attention</td>\n<td>HF 生态集成</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Triton</td>\n<td>NVIDIA</td>\n<td>多模型, 多框架</td>\n<td>企业级多模型部署</td>\n<td>BSD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ollama</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>一键运行, 本地部署</td>\n<td>开发与体验</td>\n<td>MIT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LMDeploy</td>\n<td>InternLM</td>\n<td>TurboMind 推理引擎</td>\n<td>国产模型部署</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SGLang</td>\n<td>UC Berkeley</td>\n<td>RadixAttention, 快速</td>\n<td>复杂 LLM 程序</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vllm\">vLLM</h2><p>vLLM 是当前最流行的高性能 LLM 服务框架。其核心创新是 PagedAttention——借鉴操作系统虚拟内存的思想管理 KV 缓存：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph PagedAttention&#10;        R[&quot;请求 KV Cache&quot;] --&gt; BM[&quot;Block Manager&quot;]&#10;        BM --&gt; P1[&quot;物理块 1&quot;]&#10;        BM --&gt; P2[&quot;物理块 2&quot;]&#10;        BM --&gt; P3[&quot;物理块 3&quot;]&#10;        BM --&gt; PF[&quot;空闲块池&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph PagedAttention\n        R[\"请求 KV Cache\"] --&gt; BM[\"Block Manager\"]\n        BM --&gt; P1[\"物理块 1\"]\n        BM --&gt; P2[\"物理块 2\"]\n        BM --&gt; P3[\"物理块 3\"]\n        BM --&gt; PF[\"空闲块池\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# vLLM 启动服务&#10;# python -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server \\&#10;#     --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\&#10;#     --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\&#10;#     --max-model-len 8192 \\&#10;#     --gpu-memory-utilization 0.9&#10;&#10;vllm_config = {&#10;    &quot;model&quot;: &quot;meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct&quot;,&#10;    &quot;tensor_parallel_size&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;max_model_len&quot;: 8192,&#10;    &quot;gpu_memory_utilization&quot;: 0.9,&#10;    &quot;dtype&quot;: &quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    &quot;quantization&quot;: None,&#10;    &quot;max_num_seqs&quot;: 256,&#10;}&#10;&#10;print(&quot;vLLM 服务配置:&quot;)&#10;for k, v in vllm_config.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;  {k}: {v}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># vLLM 启动服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># python -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --max-model-len 8192 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --gpu-memory-utilization 0.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vllm_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"tensor_parallel_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"max_model_len\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"gpu_memory_utilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"dtype\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"quantization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"max_num_seqs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vLLM 服务配置:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vllm_config.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>客户端调用（兼容 OpenAI API）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# from openai import OpenAI&#10;# client = OpenAI(base_url=&quot;http://localhost:8000/v1&quot;, api_key=&quot;EMPTY&quot;)&#10;#&#10;# response = client.chat.completions.create(&#10;#     model=&quot;meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct&quot;,&#10;#     messages=[&#10;#         {&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;什么是 PagedAttention?&quot;}&#10;#     ],&#10;#     temperature=0.7,&#10;#     max_tokens=512,&#10;# )&#10;# print(response.choices[0].message.content)&#10;&#10;print(&quot;vLLM 提供 OpenAI 兼容 API，可无缝替换 OpenAI 调用&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># from openai import OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># client = OpenAI(base_url=\"http://localhost:8000/v1\", api_key=\"EMPTY\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># response = client.chat.completions.create(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     model=\"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     messages=[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#         {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"什么是 PagedAttention?\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     temperature=0.7,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     max_tokens=512,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># print(response.choices[0].message.content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vLLM 提供 OpenAI 兼容 API，可无缝替换 OpenAI 调用\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tgi-text-generation-inference\">TGI (Text Generation Inference)</h2><p>TGI 是 Hugging Face 官方的推理服务器，与 HF 生态深度集成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Docker 启动 TGI&#10;# docker run --gpus all -p 8080:80 \\&#10;#     -v $PWD/data:/data \\&#10;#     ghcr.io/huggingface/text-generation-inference:latest \\&#10;#     --model-id meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\&#10;#     --quantize gptq \\&#10;#     --max-input-length 4096 \\&#10;#     --max-total-tokens 8192&#10;&#10;tgi_features = {&#10;    &quot;Flash Attention&quot;: &quot;高效注意力计算&quot;,&#10;    &quot;连续批处理&quot;: &quot;动态请求调度&quot;,&#10;    &quot;张量并行&quot;: &quot;多 GPU 模型切分&quot;,&#10;    &quot;量化支持&quot;: &quot;GPTQ, AWQ, EETQ&quot;,&#10;    &quot;流式输出&quot;: &quot;Server-Sent Events&quot;,&#10;    &quot;Token 流&quot;: &quot;逐 token 返回&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;print(&quot;TGI 核心特性:&quot;)&#10;for feature, desc in tgi_features.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;  {feature}: {desc}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Docker 启动 TGI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># docker run --gpus all -p 8080:80 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     -v $PWD/data:/data \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     ghcr.io/huggingface/text-generation-inference:latest \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --model-id meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --quantize gptq \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --max-input-length 4096 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     --max-total-tokens 8192</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tgi_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Flash Attention\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"高效注意力计算\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"连续批处理\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"动态请求调度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"张量并行\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"多 GPU 模型切分\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"量化支持\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GPTQ, AWQ, EETQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"流式输出\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Server-Sent Events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Token 流\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"逐 token 返回\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TGI 核心特性:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature, desc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tgi_features.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"